Feather Icons v4.29.2
Source: https://github.com/feathericons/feather/tree/v4.29.2
License source: https://github.com/feathericons/feather/blob/v4.29.2/LICENSE

The following SVG icons are embedded in index.html:
- icons/file-text.svg: arXiv link
- icons/github.svg: Code link
- icons/database.svg: Data link
- icons/youtube.svg: Video link
- icons/copy.svg: BibTeX copy button

The official SVG geometry is unchanged. Stroke width is adjusted from 2
to 1.7; dimensions are controlled by the page's CSS. The SVGs are embedded
inline without the standalone XML namespace and with aria-hidden="true"
because the surrounding controls already have text labels.

